Files: native/deepfilter/model/*
Copyright: 2021 Hendrik Schröter
License: Expat or Apache-2.0
Comment: DeepFilterNet3_onnx.tar.gz, the DeepFilterNet 3 model from the
 DeepFilterNet repository at tag v0.5.6, put here by
 packaging/ppa/make-source.sh. native/Makefile checks its SHA-256.

Files: native/deepfilter/vendor/*
Copyright: The authors of each crate, as its Cargo.toml names them
License: Expat and Apache-2.0
Comment: Rust crates that DeepFilterNet's library is built from, vendored
 by packaging/ppa/make-source.sh because the builders have no network.
 Each crate is under the licence its own Cargo.toml and licence files
 state. Most offer a choice of MIT or Apache-2.0, a few are MIT only and
 prost is Apache-2.0 only; tiny-keccak (CC0-1.0) and unicode-ident (which
 adds Unicode-DFS-2016) run only at build time. The Windows import
 libraries of the winapi and windows_* crates are removed, and those crates
 are never built for Linux. To list every crate with its licence, run in
 native/deepfilter:
 cargo metadata --format-version 1 --filter-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu

